      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D89810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太受寒對身體不好嘛。\n等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有興趣時，再告訴我一聲吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A53D75BD25C0D8EAB9AD44E0D597D561B3002000A7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B3670982088DA36642FF0C518D544A8A3462114E0080725427300200100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我終於能說出嚮往已久的台詞了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117D4265BC80FD8AAA51FA56AE5F805DF24E45768453F08A5E4E86FF0100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊哈哈！\n好了，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳做好覺悟了嗎！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A54C854C8FF01000A597D4E86FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3505A597D89BA609F4E8655CEFF0100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳小有實力呢！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n好吧……！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可以前往下一個房間了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B35C0F67095BE6529B5462FF0100100001BE01000A597D542720262026FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF4EE5524D5F804E0B4E00500B623F95934E86FF0100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……\n我模仿得太過頭了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE544020262026000A62116A214EFF5F97592A904E982D4E86300200100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳真強！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n話說，寶可夢就算被凍住了\n也會自動融化。<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可以放心。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3771F5F37FF0100100001BE01000A8A718AAAFF0C5BF653EF59225C317B9788AB51CD4F4F4E86000A4E5F670381EA52D5878D5316300200100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF4EE5653E5FC3300200100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是已經學會了火焰輪、\n蒸汽爆炸或是閃焰衝鋒，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也可以用這些招式讓冰融化。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F5DF27D935B7867034E86706B71308F2A3001000A84B86C7D720670B86216662F95837130885D92D2FF0C00100001BE00000A4E5F53EF4EE5752890194E9B62DB5F0F8B9351B0878D5316300200100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說回來，在密阿雷市竟然會\n出現一片堪稱是冰原的地方，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n真是既神奇又美妙呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA56DE4F86FF0C57285BC6963F96F75E027ADF71366703000A51FA73FE4E007247582A7A31662F51B0539F7684573065B9FF0C00100001BE00000A771F662F65E2795E594753C87F8E59995462FF0100100002011401620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能享受這麼多彩多姿的變化，\n都要歸功給市區裡變多的野生寶可夢！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我打算要和冰屬性的寶可夢\n一起享用冰沙當點心喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŢ",
